WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.614
Your coding agent thinks in full sentences, and shows you none of them.

2
00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:06.514
You hear almost none of it.

3
00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:10.188
Reezyn waits for the pause, and keeps one thought.

4
00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:13.694
Adapter, cleaner, then Kokoro, on your Mac.

5
00:00:14.394 --> 00:00:17.940
Say Reezyn, and it types the draft. It never sends it.

6
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.518
Away from the desk, the session is on your phone.

7
00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:24.841
No cloud, no telemetry, no upload.

8
00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:29.814
Free, open source, a minute to install. Then it just talks.
